CandidateSummary(case_id='thrift', root_cause='Test race, not a server bug. For rocket, getActiveRequests only drops when the request object is destroyed (after it moves to the finished list, possibly after the write flush), which lags the req1 handler posting baton1. The loop waiting for 2 active requests can exit on req1 and req2 before req3 reaches the server, so the snapshot has 2 entries. Fix waits for active requests to reach 0 after baton1.', patch_path='/home/newton/work/dev-hermit/worktrees/slots/tfa-phase2-cyber-opus/ignored/tfa-phase2-three-case/investigation/thrift/agent-output/patch.diff')
